      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4293889,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1760000000041,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Qdrant answers: “Which text looks relevant?”\nNeo4j answers: “Which explicit code/route links exist?”\n\nSimilarity is not proof of a dependency.\nA page route is not proof every control is mapped.\n\nCurrent UI crawl is configured/scripted, not a complete autonomous browser exploration.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Qdrant answers: “Which text looks relevant?”\nNeo4j answers: “Which explicit code/route links exist?”\n\nSimilarity is not proof of a dependency.\nA page route is not proof every control is mapped.\n\nCurrent UI crawl is configured/scripted, not a complete autonomous browser exploration.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
